      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Aaargh. I kinda need this...! 😨\nThe default input fields have a bug that limits them to 16k characters, instead of several million. That's, uh... quite the limitation! And I don't think VRChat can work around that, it's a bug in Unity itself.\nhttps://answers.unity.com/questions/1685113/unity-limits-text-field-input-to-16k-characters.html\nhttps://forum.unity.com/threads/increasing-input-field-max-character-limit.813048/\nhttps://answers.unity.com/questions/1549998/inputfields-limits-characters-unwantedly-even-with.html\n`TMPro.TMP_Text` does not have this issue since 2016, soooo please please please can we have this? 🙏\nhttps://forum.unity.com/threads/ui-text-character-limit.359729/",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
